# GitHub Actions 模板

## 创建 Issue 模板

```json
{
  "name": "create-issue",
  "description": "创建 GitHub Issue 模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "workflow": "github-issue",
  "template": {
    "title": "",
    "body": "",
    "labels": [],
    "assignees": []
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Bug: 登录失败",
      "body": "## 问题描述\n登录时提示错误\n\n## 重现步骤\n1. 打开应用\n2. 点击登录\n3. 输入账号密码\n\n## 预期行为\n正常登录",
      "labels": ["bug"],
      "assignees": ["@username"]
    },
    {
      "title": "Feature: 添加天气功能",
      "body": "## 功能描述\n添加实时天气查询功能\n\n## 需求说明\n- 查询当前天气\n- 查询未来预报\n- 支持多城市",
      "labels": ["feature"],
      "assignees": []
    }
  ],
  "usage": {
    "command": "gh issue create",
    "params": {
      "--title": "标题",
      "--body": "内容",
      "--label": "标签",
      "--assignee": "指派人"
    }
  }
}
```

## Pull Request 模板

```json
{
  "name": "create-pr",
  "description": "创建 Pull Request 模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "workflow": "github-pr",
  "template": {
    "title": "",
    "body": "",
    "base": "main",
    "head": ""
  },
  "prBody": {
    "sections": [
      "## 改动内容",
      "## 测试说明",
      "## 相关 Issue",
      "## 截图（如果有 UI 改动）"
    ],
    "checklist": [
      "[ ] 代码已测试",
      "[ ] 文档已更新",
      "[ ] Lint 通过"
    ]
  }
}
```

## Issue 处理工作流

```json
{
  "name": "issue-workflow",
  "description": "GitHub Issue 完整处理工作流",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "List Issues",
      "command": "gh issue list --state open --limit 10",
      "output": "issueList"
    },
    {
      "name": "View Issue",
      "command": "gh issue view {issueNumber}",
      "output": "issueDetail"
    },
    {
      "name": "Add Comment",
      "command": "gh issue comment {issueNumber} --body \"正在处理...\"",
      "output": "commentResult"
    },
    {
      "name": "Close Issue",
      "command": "gh issue close {issueNumber}",
      "output": "closeResult"
    }
  ]
}
```

## GitHub CLI 速查

```bash
# Issues
gh issue list                    # 列出 Issues
gh issue view 1                  # 查看 Issue
gh issue create --title "标题"   # 创建 Issue
gh issue close 1                 # 关闭 Issue
gh issue reopen 1                # 重新打开

# Pull Requests
gh pr list                       # 列出 PRs
gh pr view 1                     # 查看 PR
gh pr create --title "标题"      # 创建 PR
gh pr merge 1                    # 合并 PR
gh pr checkout 1                 # 检出 PR

# Actions
gh run list                      # 列出运行
gh run view 1                    # 查看运行
gh run watch 1                   # 监控运行

# 查看状态
gh repo view                     # 查看仓库
gh status                        # 查看状态
```

